Third-party components
----------------------

Vey uses three upstream models. None of their weights are committed to this
repository; each is fetched from the Hugging Face hub at run time. Copyright
and attribution remain with the upstream authors.

1. Default English semantic encoder: `mixedbread-ai/mxbai-embed-xsmall-v1`,
   by the Mixedbread AI authors, Apache License 2.0. Vey does not modify or
   retrain it. Vey trains small heads and selectors on top of the frozen
   representation.

2. Field encoder: `microsoft/deberta-v3-xsmall`, by Microsoft, MIT License.
   The published field artifact (`field.safetensors`) is a fine-tune of this
   encoder plus a head trained by the Vey project. Because the encoder weights
   are MIT-licensed, the MIT copyright notice applies to that portion of the
   artifact:

       Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
       Licensed under the MIT License.

3. Predicate grounder: `tasksource/ModernBERT-base-nli`, Apache License 2.0,
   itself a fine-tune of `answerdotai/ModernBERT-base`. Vey uses it frozen for
   the CRUX lane's categorical predicates and does not redistribute its
   weights.

